  "body": "## What's Changed\n\nA patch release with fixes for rules that reused configuration across runs and for false positives/negatives.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> `add-constant` now inspects nested call arguments and function literal signatures (#1843), so existing projects may see new findings after upgrading.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n* `add-constant`: inspect nested arguments by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1843\n* `add-constant`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1839\n* `banned-characters`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1851\n* `enforce-switch-style`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1849\n* `file-header`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1853\n* `file-length-limit`: reset configuration by @AdamMagued in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1856\n* `import-alias-naming`: reset configuration by @AdamMagued in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1859\n* `string-format`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1833\n* `struct-tag`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1841\n* `unhandled-error`: reset configuration by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1837\n* `var-naming`: reset configuration by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1845\n* Reset configuration in `Configure` by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1889\n* `enforce-repeated-arg-type-style`: fix error message by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1880\n* `function-length`: continue after empty function by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1827\n* `max-public-structs`: count only structs by @dajiaohuang in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1829\n* `max-public-structs`: do not count Unicode names by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1878\n* `struct-tag`: track tag numbers per tag key by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1887\n* `unnecessary-format`: handle escaped percent by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1884\n* `unnecessary-if`: handle same branch values by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1883\n* `unnecessary-stmt`: ignore switch with only default by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1885\n* Escape all regexp metacharacters in literal file filters by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1886\n* Include all configured SARIF rules by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1823\n\n### Documentation\n* Migrate repo to revive-lint organization by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1806\n* Add \"Revive version\" to \"Available Rules\" table by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1807\n* Add revive version to rules descriptions by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1808\n* Update sections in release policy by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1805\n\n### Dependency Updates\n* Update `github.com/revive-lint/dots` to v1.1.0 by @alexandear in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1882\n\n## New Contributors\n* @dajiaohuang made their first contribution in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1827\n* @AdamMagued made their first contribution in https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/pull/1856\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/revive-lint/revive/compare/v1.17.0...v1.17.1\n",
